<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>"What's wrong? Not going?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm... going to face what I did. I belong in that other world after all."</STYLE><PG>
"You sure you're okay? You've been suffering all this time, haven't you?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"True. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But if I run, there are people who'll grieve. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm going back for their sake too."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体前春花笑顔閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"I see. Yeah, if that's what you think, I'm sure that's best."<PG>
"But no regrets, okay? I'm rooting for you."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yeah. Say hi to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> for me."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体前春花笑顔.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"Yeah. See you..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n立木三日\r\n3\r\n346\r\n1000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"It's fine. This is how it should be..."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you. For pushing me this far."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花にこり.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"After all you've done, I can't let you see me looking pathetic."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"<VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">, watch me from this world. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">How I'll live. How I'll face what I did."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I have people who are precious to me. The people of the dimension I was in. No one else."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Natsumi's</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> gone, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">her</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> last wish, I'll make it come true."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm going to open my eyes. I can't make the people I care about worry any longer."</STYLE><PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日目閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, let me ask one last thing. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\春花通常.lcm" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Are you glad you came to this world?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="NOREPAGE">
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
